  "body_html": "<h1>Determined Game</h1>\n<p>A simple two-player game is determined if one of the two players has a winning\nstrategy.</p>\n<p>Because the winning sets $R_1$ and $R_2$ are disjoint, both players cannot have\nwinning strategies simultaneously.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Def. 6.2.2] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>. A game is determined if one player has a winning strategy.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
