      "signature": "def IsZeroSum : GameTree (Fin 2) ℚ → Prop\n  | Leaf p => p 0 + p 1 = 0\n  | Node _ h t => IsZeroSum h ∧ ∀ c ∈ t, IsZeroSum c\n/-- The head child of a zero-sum node is zero-sum. -/",
